he may have also found a flat and a flat mate in Tammarrah...and maybe even her first story.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/weuRSOTipq4EYO2SSJKNGkA5sJP.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQ2FsbC1NZS1CYWUtJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.4","title":"Bae Tries to Fit In","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2024-09-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Bae is struggling with tussles with Tammarah at home, while Satyajit at work makes her life a living hell. To add to the confusion, a blast from her past shows up at her doorstep.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y3rdpYbbuN2N2Ia0IYyOQjBBK13.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQ2FsbC1NZS1CYWUtJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.5","title":"Triple Trouble For Bae","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2024-09-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Bae plunges into the investigation of an important story with help from Tammarrah, Saira and Prince, while her love life hangs on a precipice with Neel, Prince and Agastya in the mix.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8ZI4r5kQh1rYQ9tyPrk2Km05Bdn.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQ2FsbC1NZS1CYWUtJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.6","title":"Bae Tries to be a Journalist","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2024-09-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Bae’s spirit to get to the bottom of the story is deterred when she finds herself forced to confront the past she has been working to move on from. When she lands on her face, help comes from an unexpected source.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1p7xkAQn6oXtYBdjbU5gM6dwKGA.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQ2FsbC1NZS1CYWUtJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.7","title":"Bae Cracks the Code","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2024-09-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Reinvigorated, Bae goes all in on her investigation to help the person who trusted her, leading her and her friends to land up in a soup with a dangerous man.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yVVG6ofPG4s6Kv9kqyogHJDzUyq.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQ2FsbC1NZS1CYWUtJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.8","title":"Bae’s Revelations","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2024-09-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"With her besties by her side, Bae takes on the men she wants to bring to justice, and her own shame, in a big televised spectacle. Is Bae ready to bring it on?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ieNwpHLGqgyylLCRzGxS4kHDfxE.jpg"}]}}